AUDIO: 'works differently. Claude code can be refactoring the background while you keep talking to the voice agent. And when the task finishes, it can interrupt you and tell you it\'s done. And here\'s the weird part. Quen audio agent isn\'t a'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
